Role-Based Access Control

Implement server-enforced role-based access control.

Initial roles:

* Super Administrator.
* Company Manager.
* Sales Representative.
* Project Manager.
* Accountant.
* Execution Team Member.

Define granular permissions for reading, creating, editing, publishing, exporting, and deleting relevant records.

Apply authorization checks on every protected server endpoint and sensitive object operation. Hiding a button in the frontend is not authorization.

